OL,3,AStudent-backed election winners demand
OL,4,Asweeping resignations in Serbia
OL,5,
OL,6,FSerbia's victorious student-led
OL,7,Fmovement has called for top figures in
OL,8,Fthe police, intelligence and judiciary
OL,9,Fto stand down, days after ousting
OL,10,Fex-president Aleksandar VuDMiDG's party
OL,11,Ffrom power.
OL,13,FStanding in Pioneers' Park opposite
OL,14,Fparliament, newly elected MPs on the
OL,15,FStudent List demanded the immediate
OL,16,Fdismissal of all police officers who
OL,17,Fhad broken the law, singling out the
OL,18,Fheads of the police, the BIA security
OL,19,Fagency and anti-terror unit.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
