OL,3,AStudent-backed election winners demand
OL,4,Asweeping resignations in Serbia
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not often a European country
OL,7,Fvotes to fully reset its political
OL,8,Fsystem overnight, and Serbians have
OL,9,Fvoted to hand the task to a group of
OL,10,Fnovice politicians, made up of
OL,11,Fintellectuals, professors, artists,
OL,12,Fathletes and as many as 12 medical
OL,13,Fdoctors and surgeons.
OL,15,FBut the handover of power will take
OL,16,Fweeks, and the students' movement is
OL,17,Fconcerned that evidence of possible
OL,18,Fwrongdoing could be destroyed in that
OL,19,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
